<title>JAPAN: Japan Apr-Jun industrial output seen down 0.8% q/q.</title>
<headline>Japan Apr-Jun industrial output seen down 0.8% q/q.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's industrial production is forecast to fall 0.8 percent in the April-June quarter from the previous quarter but rise 6.0 percent from the year-ago period, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Monday.</p>
